<style>
form{
   text-align:center;
}
#submit-btn{
    padding:3px;
    color:ivory;
    background:purple;
    padding:3px;
}
p {
   width:80%;
   background:lightsteelblue;
   border:1px solid black;
   color:black;
   padding:10px;
}
</style>
<%- include('../partials/header_html'); %>

<body>
    <div id='wrapper'>
    <%- include('../partials/header_img'); %>
    <%- include('../partials/navbar'); %>
    
    
    <div class='page-content' >
              
       <p class='h3 title'>Download FASTA</p>
    <form id='' action='download_fasta' method='POST' enctype="multipart/form-data">
    <br>
    Annotations: (require specific protein_id formats)&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;
    <input type='radio' checked name='anno' value='bakta'> BAKTA&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;
    <input type='radio'  name='anno' value='prokka'> PROKKA&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;
    <input type='radio' name='anno' value='ncbi'> NCBI
    <br><br>
    Sequence Type:&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;
    <input type='radio' checked name='table' value='faa'> Protein&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;
    <input type='radio' name='table' value='ffn'> Nucleotide
    <br><br>
    <strong>Required:</strong> File of Protein-IDs 
    <br>One ID per line and no formatting or other information.
    <br><small>LIMIT 1000 lines (one ID per line)</small>
    <br><br>
    <label for="file-upload">Choose a file of protein-IDs:</label>
    <input type="file" id="file-upload" name="myFile">
    <br><br> 
    <center><p>To get a list of protein_ids you can select a genome <a href='/genome/explorer'>here</a> and download an annotation table
    or search the annotation databases <a href='/search/full_site_search'>here</a> and download an annotation table.
    Note that BAKTA, PROKKA and NCBI protein_ids each have a different format. Only one format is allowed in the upload file.
    We will parse the format (based on the underscore '_' count) and try to select the correct annotation database.
    </p>
    </center>
    <br><br><br>
    <button id='submit-btn' type="submit">Create FASTA</button>
    </form>
  
    </div> <!-- end: page-content -->
    
    <div id='footer'>
         <%- include('../partials/footer'); %>
    </div>
       
</body>

</html>

